#!/bin/sh
REALNAME=$1 #PPPx
REALDEV=$2	#nas0_x
IP=$4		#ip
GW=$5		#gateway
WWAN=$( echo $REALDEV | grep "ttyUSB")
if [ "$WWAN" != "" ]
then
	REALDEV=$REALNAME
fi
rm -f /var/wan_connection_notify/$REALDEV"_connection_is_up"
touch /var/wan_connection_notify/$REALDEV"_connection_is_up"
echo "RDMNAME config;" >> /var/wan_connection_notify/$REALDEV"_connection_is_up"
echo "EVENTNOTIFY 206 string $REALNAME;" >> /var/wan_connection_notify/$REALDEV"_connection_is_up"
ccctest -f /var/wan_connection_notify/$REALDEV"_connection_is_up"
